2" lrx="567" lry="1451" /><zone xml:id="m-f075bed0-1aa0-431f-bfeb-51700fb3edf1" ulx="128" uly="1443" lrx="566" lry="1481" /><zone xml:id="m-f16e6745-0679-477e-ba3f-fd8b8a70ad64" ulx="580" uly="1446" lrx="1021" lry="1483" /><zone xml:id="m-2418d3c1-0f0b-451d-bcf0-5be4e0d0c6c4" ulx="130" uly="1473" lrx="567" lry="1505" /><zone xml:id="m-280e29ef-451a-4b93-9e7c-8d5de2b88f30" ulx="580" uly="1474" lrx="1022" lry="1508" /><zone xml:id="m-bcf88300-c6f8-4187-91b2-090523f5fcd9" ulx="129" uly="1501" lrx="570" lry="1535" /><zone xml:id="m-9a1937d1-b075-4149-b093-b489c3f31e37" ulx="580" uly="1502" lrx="1020" lry="1540" /><zone xml:id="m-8ced8f3b-1ee2-403e-88c1-79bbd5631b7c" ulx="578" uly="1527" lrx="816" lry="1571" /><zone xml:id="m-9a7c9c68-f0c3-4039-9579-657d08701556" ulx="129" uly="1528" lrx="571" lry="1565" /><zone xml:id="m-4beec7de-05b0-45b2-85e4-ecf76005a4fd" ulx="131" uly="1553" lrx="571" lry="1595" /><zone xml:id="m-16f0a106-b41e-4f4d-8c02-cb78d4b6b094" ulx="902" uly="1553" lrx="992" lry="1595" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-76fa3c65-5f3b-4ed4-92d9-756e204a79d5" n="1654" facs="#m-19101200-a2a2-41c7-aa60-742db7d13431" /><div xml:id="m-5337339a-5565-4245-907c-e5b94f8a8201">
            <lg xml:id="m-07ac692a-79c4-461a-9e99-8bca4f76295f">
              <l xml:id="m-8f5fb6db-e281-41f6-ba1f-862fc8a5d818" facs="#m-69091b25-e53b-4764-aff6-26cbcb04da0c" label="ambiguous">May 2.</l><l xml:id="m-68e084eb-4305-4da6-aa4b-848d3dc3ac66" facs="#m-42ac840a-2add-41e9-a089-d793844defe1" label="ambiguous">1452</l><l xml:id="m-14b69b21-21c5-402d-867a-bb538af4434f" facs="#m-e5631fdd-5b44-4a6e-9dc4-37989f860809" label="ambiguous">St. Athanasius, Bishop, Confessor</l><l xml:id="m-b9281d1f-688c-4e5c-8729-4e9d7f8a0a9a" facs="#m-b7b05db8-4ef4-4023-9fb8-2f94a45ee18f" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-dcf85032-5c1e-4795-a07a-6fef85001974" facs="#m-ccf5eff5-fb6c-4686-98b7-e0779e56bbd1" label="text-like">and Doctor of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-0b21fc9b-c71c-47e0-a5d0-a85365a28c94" facs="#m-f98ac56b-f56a-43da-94af-9b5d54f43b11" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-988cbc6c-c910-4b3e-9dc1-d766cf5bc998" facs="#m-e346de58-3c9e-4a96-9c3c-89cb5f1c4507" label="lyrics-like">At Vespers, at Magn. Ant. O Dóctor óptime... beâte Athanási.</l><l xml:id="m-1cf471b8-1924-4423-8787-7d4c421403e2" facs="#m-3cff91e0-e3ef-469b-b45c-e1090ef4b1c5" label="text-like">At Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-bface932-c131-43a3-a964-170456708e0e" facs="#m-eba194e9-6dc5-445d-90dc-9352f159e0ac" label="lyrics-like">Introit. In médio Ecclésiae. p. 1190.</l><l xml:id="m-b79069e4-c043-46bb-b727-240600a930a1" facs="#m-f6fde457-610f-4a3f-a4c9-570d2e850e86" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-ca3f39c8-5c74-4b6f-b344-91265b8a38cf" facs="#m-92c8fb37-97f7-43a5-a79e-da009d8448ac" label="lyrics-like">(xáudi, quaésumus, Dómine, pre-! tibi digne méruit famulári, ejus in¬</l><l xml:id="m-9331c5a4-fc1e-4c81-a9c3-8303fea234a4" facs="#m-4be83285-e732-4edb-b487-3d3aaa0fe7bb" label="lyrics-like">L ces nostras, quas in beáti Atha- tercedéntibus méritis, * ab ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-d487af49-4995-4d41-89aa-c6741e221edc" facs="#m-33d8a1b1-097e-40cd-9ee0-b3fe6ec0b0d1" label="lyrics-like">nos absólve peccátis. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-486aa63f-6d0d-4251-a46b-1c0d990bd2ec" facs="#m-f8098d5b-b690-4ab9-b904-944d9cbf48d0" label="lyrics-like">násii Confessóris tui atque Pontifi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c399e3b3-cde6-4a87-b261-3e58d4b51637" facs="#m-4c3caa32-2b80-4d9a-add1-389e0587351c" label="lyrics-like">cis solemnitáte deférimus : t et, qui</l><l xml:id="m-f61c2e68-dc39-4a0f-be32-55422ce29d1b" facs="#m-6c470c31-3b97-4411-8385-85784235478c" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. 2. Cor. 4,5-14</l><l xml:id="m-e85c5a11-5adb-4edd-b801-fa95a2ce102f" facs="#m-e1713054-3430-4ffc-aa31-a6c99050cf94" label="lyrics-like">L'Ratres: Non nosmetípsos prac- mortificatiónem Jesu in córpore no¬</l><l xml:id="m-488183f5-d9f5-4aee-aaa5-540e6f4b2f92" facs="#m-0edff027-9bcc-478f-8501-55a7c1087504" label="lyrics-like">F dicámus, sed Jesum Christum</l><l xml:id="m-32f76bf2-636f-4b85-b2c4-61a0b9b7886a" facs="#m-5e8a63bf-e537-4fe5-b9ab-5c272dc82584" label="lyrics-like">stro circumferéntes, ut et vita lesu</l><l xml:id="m-d65f1d2a-a063-45a5-a040-913d08f6a355" facs="#m-4fdd3593-6bf6-4caa-a3f5-1cf55026cb06" label="lyrics-like">manifestétur in corpóribus nostris.</l><l xml:id="m-4460bd37-4030-407e-8089-89c5d4ee61bb" facs="#m-0636ca22-ea45-4df8-bcff-7305279b0641" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum nostrum : nos autem ser¬</l><l xml:id="m-c02960cd-5c42-4a45-ba98-ef27f3e75e05" facs="#m-6729975a-d1cc-4e1d-ba98-22d2e7555c64" label="ambiguous">Semper enim nos, qui vivimus, in</l><l xml:id="m-0d61d69f-d761-49b4-96b5-eff69a3469f1" facs="#m-228103e5-c813-4bf1-857a-e82b5a168abc" label="lyrics-like">vos vestros per Jesum: quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-91950ad2-e981-478c-8310-39f10b5e1d57" facs="#m-0b2359fd-84db-4977-b06f-6ef022d6abfa" label="lyrics-like">Deus, qui dixit de ténebris lucem</l><l xml:id="m-3c498996-d410-49bc-8b2f-b41ebe229c43" facs="#m-79db111f-8785-463c-a18d-1303af6e77c5" label="lyrics-like">mortem trádimur propter Jesum:</l><l xml:id="m-e1c89168-43c2-476e-af4e-1b1b64a0d823" facs="#m-0670fe5c-4102-4187-a7fd-159033d4c82c" label="lyrics-like">splendéscere, ipse illúxit in córdibus</l><l xml:id="m-5587cfbd-0c76-40b8-88a7-ebd566a70e50" facs="#m-a0344ddb-5338-4872-bccd-d3ac7f0af6d4" label="lyrics-like">ut et vita Jesu manifestétur in carne</l><l xml:id="m-f69bb041-52c8-411b-b4f7-4754b1b23591" facs="#m-0aa8198e-6257-46cb-9cab-e110605f3af8" label="lyrics-like">nostris ad illuminatiónem sciéntiae</l><l xml:id="m-53714fd3-bad8-44fe-9820-38e3311ce4b4" facs="#m-8e7f9ed6-a4eb-4228-8770-ed7eeb4a70fc" label="lyrics-like">nostra mortáli. Ergo mors in nobis</l><l xml:id="m-4c33fa21-6662-4987-84ae-8d0b7e62ca6b" facs="#m-7e13ab78-9900-4c39-9c55-7c154191c4bc" label="lyrics-like">claritátis Dei, in fácie Christi Jesu.</l><l xml:id="m-0c0cc0ec-c480-4cd4-99ce-43b9d63e6fcf" facs="#m-02f74c95-ba76-41b1-a3a9-30b4a7618a97" label="lyrics-like">operátur, vita autem in vobis. Ha¬</l><l xml:id="m-cae0798f-3aa3-40db-ba09-fb496bae499a" facs="#m-abfe8b75-2a82-4191-a78a-3ecdb682df03" label="lyrics-like">béntes autem eúmdem spiritum</l><l xml:id="m-fc107bfd-716e-4c1a-b882-848557131620" facs="#m-55751022-1d9c-4984-b15f-fe1398d3d0a3" label="lyrics-like">Habémus autem thesáurum istum</l><l xml:id="m-ccbb74f1-03f8-4d4b-be27-1938b8871ee5" facs="#m-9c79865a-b79d-4ef7-9311-aa6aa8dfd837" label="lyrics-like">fidei, sicut scriptum est: Crédidi,</l><l xml:id="m-9db38de9-e113-493e-8c3d-737b76d57644" facs="#m-d7a71e0e-63af-4cea-be35-cf1335e78fa1" label="ambiguous">in vasis fictilibus : ut sublimitas sit</l><l xml:id="m-8719888e-7e27-4a52-b626-051ad602dedb" facs="#m-92324f95-7b2d-4a1c-ad72-f772f2cfbfa4" label="lyrics-like">virtútis Dei, et non ex nobis. In</l><l xml:id="m-5a31158f-4b19-47c5-88c9-5217c1f22022" facs="#m-ab4efde8-396e-4e77-808e-d7a7cab58564" label="lyrics-like">propter quod locútus sum : et nos</l><l xml:id="m-59c9961c-05ef-4b12-8e71-ab47cc8fc039" facs="#m-e55a4bc6-0711-4965-8cff-90411c478896" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus tribulatiónem pátimur, sed</l><l xml:id="m-7c20e1bc-9f6c-4fbe-824f-5569e3d97e71" facs="#m-f087b5ef-d2d3-4b4c-8a83-daaebe2a0b44" label="lyrics-like">crédimus, propter quod et lóqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-96c4ed17-3a19-4a0d-8a04-b786339f58be" facs="#m-cc50cf26-b409-49e4-ac36-6fd2b8fab78b" label="lyrics-like">mur : sciéntes, quóniam qui susci¬</l><l xml:id="m-8fe65247-7a2d-4c1f-9617-154c4697e20a" facs="#m-8bc3090e-1d28-4adc-aa6f-9e31a441000c" label="lyrics-like">non angustiámur : aporiámur, sed</l><l xml:id="m-f5c8708b-91e0-408a-a626-08099c4002b3" facs="#m-620ecff1-25ef-4b08-b293-498ebb4cc512" label="lyrics-like">non destitúimur: persecutiónem</l><l xml:id="m-78b11c9f-ee0f-45bb-a37a-d8ce32d31f23" facs="#m-67215781-d95b-4fd4-94a8-66d975316062" label="lyrics-like">távit Jesum, et nos cum Jesu susci¬</l><l xml:id="m-03d7c5e0-e48b-481a-a0a8-2d29cea303c2" facs="#m-b108db08-ddb3-4467-99cf-44978a66a20d" label="lyrics-like">pátimur, sed non derelinquimur : tábit, et constituet vobiscum.</l><l xml:id="m-21c07318-9aec-4466-870c-c2b1d1062af7" facs="#m-06976b91-9787-4c2c-b4ea-edc6f842f416" label="lyrics-like">dejícimur, sed non perimus : semper</l><l xml:id="m-641dbc75-b463-4059-9c60-a07a5189ce55" facs="#m-09a31d10-7d67-45ab-bd7f-1968b51b68d0" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia, allelúia. Tu es sacérdos. p. 118</l><l xml:id="m-4c544293-a699-485b-9c7f-4acdc9363d70" facs="#m-24ffd43b-20d0-4c1f-8c79-ec172b20dacf" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia. V. Beátus vir qui súffert. p. 1202.</l><l xml:id="m-98b502cf-ba82-407e-969c-ab4de8b65d5c" facs="#m-e19a04b1-c0d3-4c7d-bc7b-6783a413bb21" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. 108</l><l xml:id="m-3625d1e7-26f9-48a4-bbb2-802718dae0c7" facs="#m-f92f93dc-0424-443d-ba5a-cfd2674b5c04" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore : Dixit Jesus discí- timuéritis eos. Nihil enim est opér¬</l><l xml:id="m-177eb181-1941-461e-96a9-c668e10aaea8" facs="#m-fe3b3157-e37e-446a-bb28-38d964e1ac8d" label="lyrics-like">L pulis suis : Cum persequéntur vos</l><l xml:id="m-7c72a2e6-5c36-4d67-b4c8-27419a35a58b" facs="#m-c206cec0-22d0-41a8-a76b-1ce3d61eff89" label="lyrics-like">tum, quod non revelábitur: et</l><l xml:id="m-d40bdc30-c281-4af4-aa1c-2902dfddbb15" facs="#m-576a1104-5b62-4533-81a4-6c2d327a1d04" label="lyrics-like">in civitáte ista, fúgite in aliam.</l><l xml:id="m-0dd2a0a0-b6a7-4b80-83d6-1dbdd627c4d0" facs="#m-302bfcad-c14f-4567-ac66-b1ef5e8e23e6" label="lyrics-like">occúltum, quod non sciétur. Quod</l><l xml:id="m-abd583b3-b9a2-4220-9315-944fbb19b7e2" facs="#m-8d5b9ac6-79c7-4d9f-ba15-abb9a1b8b98f" label="lyrics-like">dico vobis in ténebris, dicite in</l><l xml:id="m-9b44b481-d91f-4b51-9948-5a3c5f245bd6" facs="#m-f8da1c83-21ee-40b7-930a-62f113702684" label="lyrics-like">Amen dico vobis, non consummá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4211abf0-910d-404e-ad29-65e64e19c0f6" facs="#m-153a8c78-3467-4bd9-9be6-07ddd1e47c45" label="lyrics-like">bitis civitátes Israël, donec véniat</l><l xml:id="m-0e44ce71-d216-4250-8993-daefe61f26f3" facs="#m-8d8264bd-0df1-434a-be88-40abec8ab20f" label="lyrics-like">lúmine: et quod in aure audítis,</l><l xml:id="m-d9c9829e-34bb-41ef-9845-9e64065be17e" facs="#m-d506e51b-df5a-470c-ac7a-9621af4b8292" label="lyrics-like">Filius hóminis. Non est discipulus</l><l xml:id="m-e79c6fa5-1a07-4def-a052-0234fee9e4bb" facs="#m-c145cd20-5f2e-4330-a4df-5b27908c0fbb" label="lyrics-like">praedicáte super tecta. Et nolite</l><l xml:id="m-a580dd80-6212-4609-9aef-de3db3a9d9db" facs="#m-5f189b78-3688-4654-97a2-d30affdfaafa" label="lyrics-like">timére cos, qui occidunt corpus,</l><l xml:id="m-77d254ce-60c8-49c7-a26f-874c51ea5755" facs="#m-01d1d844-e870-4fc1-aeaa-79fd7d79731a" label="lyrics-like">super magístrum, nec servus super</l><l xml:id="m-4844d1e6-03a1-414a-805c-04db4f4734f7" facs="#m-f075bed0-1aa0-431f-bfeb-51700fb3edf1" label="lyrics-like">dóminum suum. Súfficit discipulo,</l><l xml:id="m-50abdcc3-1bef-4fd0-9245-14ca5f055ffd" facs="#m-f16e6745-0679-477e-ba3f-fd8b8a70ad64" label="lyrics-like">ánimam autem non possunt occi¬</l><l xml:id="m-eabfaa25-0335-402b-bcbf-ba81fca072bb" facs="#m-2418d3c1-0f0b-451d-bcf0-5be4e0d0c6c4" label="lyrics-like">ut sit sicut magíster ejus : et servo,</l><l xml:id="m-eb927222-8e04-4dfb-8343-b8e70feed880" facs="#m-280e29ef-451a-4b93-9e7c-8d5de2b88f30" label="lyrics-like">dere: sed pótius timéte eum, qui</l><l xml:id="m-bb6d1f2f-e62d-4786-a2df-4a93ee21698b" facs="#m-bcf88300-c6f8-4187-91b2-090523f5fcd9" label="lyrics-like">sicut dóminus éjus. Si patremfamí¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e9258f0-4c4b-459b-86a1-7eb05cd0d29e" facs="#m-9a1937d1-b075-4149-b093-b489c3f31e37" label="lyrics-like">potest et ánimam et corpus pér¬</l><l xml:id="m-d0ac4b2d-dad9-46f8-a9ff-d8c2d50bcc8b" facs="#m-8ced8f3b-1ee2-403e-88c1-79bbd5631b7c" label="lyrics-like">dere in gehénnam.</l><l xml:id="m-7b1278e4-4246-45db-80fc-47b646e78373" facs="#m-9a7c9c68-f0c3-4039-9579-657d08701556" label="lyrics-like">lias Beélzebub vocavérunt : quanto</l><l xml:id="m-ef82985e-aef2-41d0-91ca-0c6fdf395535" facs="#m-4beec7de-05b0-45b2-85e4-ecf76005a4fd" label="lyrics-like">magis domésticos ejus? Né ergo</l><l xml:id="m-c9f39988-c2ed-4ece-8082-ea0fd4d3123d" facs="#m-16f0a106-b41e-4f4d-8c02-cb78d4b6b094" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>